{ "Identifier":           {"ImplementerID": "1", "ImplementationID": "CAE-AOE-V1.0-I01", "AIMName": "1CAE-AOE-V1.0-I01"},
  "Header":               "CAE-AOE-V1.0",

  "APIProfile":           "Basic",
  "Description":          "Audio Object Editing. Edits Basic Audio Objects and composes Basic and full Audio Objects into Audio Objects (CAE-ASM). One Object is open at a time, so a User Command need not name its target. The Object Port accepts a Basic Audio Object or a full one and its Header says which arrived; opening is done by Port, creation opens implicitly, and acting is done by User Command. An Audio Object has no Acoustic Profile of its own: its Basic Audio Objects have one each. Every edit is a new version in Shared Storage. A Speech Object arriving is kept in Shared Storage. A User Command naming Translated Objects sends each Speech Object, read from Shared Storage, to be translated, with a Language Selector for the target language its Speech Qualifier states.",

  "InternalTypes":        [],

